"P1424460267" "Villains have arrived from Rogue Isles and are attacking Atlas Park <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Go to Atlas Park and protect the bank from those villains!</A> Once you hit Atlas Park you'll have 20 minutes to stop the attack.<br><br><color orange>This is a Safeguard mission. You can earn extra time by defeating villains, however you can lose time if they destroy too much of the city.</color>"
// AcceptString :
"P2964068792" "Protect Atlas Park bank"
// SendOffString :
"P1250471768" "The villains in Atlas Park are aware of the heist, and are trying to create diversions. The more of them you stop, the easier taking the thief out will be."
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2541866575" "Go protect Atlas Park!"
// DeclineString :
"P1500738584" "No thanks"
// DeclineSendOffString :
"P192420359" "What?! Why? {HeroName}, we need your help!"

